  planner_response {
    response: "The project has been converted from Vite to **Next.js (App Router)** while preserving the existing design, Tailwind CSS styling, and responsive layout.\n\n### Porting Overview\n\n1. **Next.js App Router Structure**:\n   - `src/app/layout.tsx`: Root Server Component configured with document metadata (`title`, `description`, `openGraph`), Google and Satoshi font links, and global styles.\n   - `src/app/page.tsx`: Main page Server Component composing all sections in order.\n   - `src/app/globals.css`: Global styles powered by Tailwind CSS with custom text-stroke and glassmorphism utilities.\n   - `next.config.mjs` & `postcss.config.mjs`: Next.js config with unoptimized static image routing and `@tailwindcss/postcss`.\n\n2. **Server & Client Component Architecture**:\n   - **Server Components** (rendered on the server for performance & SEO):\n     - `src/app/layout.tsx` (App Shell & metadata)\n     - `src/app/page.tsx` (Canvas layout)\n     - `TrainLikeChampionSection` (Boxing training details, layout, and athlete visuals)\n     - `ClientsSayingSection` (Customer reviews, ratings, and avatar cards)\n     - `FooterSection` (4-column sitemap, contact info, and copyright)\n     - `ProductDropletsOverlay` & `ShapePatternSvg` (Decorative vector droplets)\n   - **Client Components** (`\"use client\"` for interactivity, animations, and state):\n     - `HeroSection` (interactive nav, search bar, and motion effects)\n     - `OurProductsSection` (product selection & interactive add button state)\n     - `NewsletterSection` (interactive email validation and subscription status state)\n     - `HeaderNav` (search query state, outside click handling, and modal triggers)\n\n3. **Style & Asset Fidelity**:\n   - Zero changes to existing Tailwind styles, colors, typography, or component layouts.\n   - Fully verified with `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`."
    modified_response: "The project has been converted from Vite to **Next.js (App Router)** while preserving the existing design, Tailwind CSS styling, and responsive layout.\n\n### Porting Overview\n\n1. **Next.js App Router Structure**:\n   - `src/app/layout.tsx`: Root Server Component configured with document metadata (`title`, `description`, `openGraph`), Google and Satoshi font links, and global styles.\n   - `src/app/page.tsx`: Main page Server Component composing all sections in order.\n   - `src/app/globals.css`: Global styles powered by Tailwind CSS with custom text-stroke and glassmorphism utilities.\n   - `next.config.mjs` & `postcss.config.mjs`: Next.js config with unoptimized static image routing and `@tailwindcss/postcss`.\n\n2. **Server & Client Component Architecture**:\n   - **Server Components** (rendered on the server for performance & SEO):\n     - `src/app/layout.tsx` (App Shell & metadata)\n     - `src/app/page.tsx` (Canvas layout)\n     - `TrainLikeChampionSection` (Boxing training details, layout, and athlete visuals)\n     - `ClientsSayingSection` (Customer reviews, ratings, and avatar cards)\n     - `FooterSection` (4-column sitemap, contact info, and copyright)\n     - `ProductDropletsOverlay` & `ShapePatternSvg` (Decorative vector droplets)\n   - **Client Components** (`\"use client\"` for interactivity, animations, and state):\n     - `HeroSection` (interactive nav, search bar, and motion effects)\n     - `OurProductsSection` (product selection & interactive add button state)\n     - `NewsletterSection` (interactive email validation and subscription status state)\n     - `HeaderNav` (search query state, outside click handling, and modal triggers)\n\n3. **Style & Asset Fidelity**:\n   - Zero changes to existing Tailwind styles, colors, typography, or component layouts.\n   - Fully verified with `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\276\b\n\273\b\001i\024}\023\372\316\322z\033\3125\v\272\324)\221\227lS\241!{\373N\217r\0009\313b+\t\260#\303\334\023O\201\344\366\371\222e\004\370\232\322_\252\221\000>\272\315C\215l\366\021XX\223R<\362.\005\210\345C\002Qee\2163\301\364s\'o\264\240\261?\344\301\031\313\217C\035\222#\206\222D9\355\256\364\215\337\335\344Hr\251\220\270\251\235\341!\035!\004\b\0059L\003\274\224d\352\254\232\253\303\320x*xb\022}\224_\241F\bxLk\312\036S\350z>U(PUV?$\230\270\313M@\"\223\213\321\v\335\003\302\266#{\272\347\342\023\261\017\023d{\240\331\337\272B\352}\250\301\222S\273\212^\001h_G\232U\200\363\374s\023A\212\273\275x*\211\315I+\241\317\351\255\035\a\"\327\377\377\322\233\305\203\251\372\347\177\222k\253\356\321pY\3043\367\342\342S\251C\025\273\030\375\f\036\037\321\221\244\307S\004\027tuy\n\t~\017\241\217\1776y\336\256\210\352+t\236\274G?.\t\212?\t+\373\253\265E\250\340\217/\233\002\035\324#b\275l\227/g\242\256\v\256_G\263\336N\317Z\221\035\217\253C\002z\370\024\244R\377/q\227\252\004\300\341x9\371\326\275X\323\232\351P\023\353T\001P\2017O\240\354*\345\246#\244\334_!\1770J+(\263\244\350\026\022PUH\301\027\022U\r4\237R?a\276\263$\026\232\346\310\227\fn0\334\262\355\215\241\363#i\236\311qa\376\226.\025\260\254}\350\315\324t&Z\263\321f7\346\256Br\263Kt2j\215\274$p9\373(z\00080a\375\205\373$2\254*\222\313\033n\336\246\326gWAV\023X\330\336\f//\264\377\n\362\036Px\326.fiA\034\022\000\307\204\356\223\ri|\260\345\336\n\n\366#8\337A\371\200\247L\366\301\0050\000I!L\235\341\257\343\261jV\272>\356e_\356\003lQ\321F\031\3523X\311\352\275T\036;\347]\336%\\\231\000\256\020\225Ex\323_\236\241\"\225\273ee\311\271\255\331\2122\bE^Zc\237\366\264\"O\323ep\253\374\253a\261\255l\274\332\";\262\351h\272\256\247\274\245\322\213\3569\324@V\354\205j\352\261,1q\036\032~\272\351\214}\226r\237\363\326\273+Xv\251M\020I\314\024\r,\213R\321\204\314\357\311)<\213\336ugVS\345\003I5\004=\037\303]\feR\033\241\212\310m\031-(\360\214\340\030\225\204\034)\213\365]((`\2603\003C\331lw\25