  planner_response {
    response: "### What Happened and Why It Was Not Showing\n\nThe text was actually present in the code, but two issues caused it to be invisible in the browser:\n\n1. **Animation State (`opacity: 0`)**: The component was wrapped in `<motion.h1 initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 30 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}>`. During server-side rendering in Next.js, the text rendered with inline `opacity: 0`, and if the animation didn\'t immediately fire on client mount, it stayed completely invisible.\n2. **Container Clipping (`overflow-hidden`)**: The hero image container had `overflow-hidden` with `bottom: -2.8cqw`, which physically clipped and hid the typography outside its bounding box.\n\n### How It Has Been Fixed\n\n- **Guaranteed Visibility**: Removed the `opacity: 0` initial state and replaced it with direct, permanent visibility (`z-30 pointer-events-none`).\n- **Two Distinct Lines**:\n  - **Line 1**: `POWER YOUR`\n  - **Line 2**: `PONTETIALE`\n- **Zero Clipping**: Switched the wrapper containers to `overflow-visible` so the bottom position (`bottom: -2.8cqw`) is never cut off.\n- **Responsive Text Stroke**: Applied `WebkitTextStroke: \"max(1.2px, 0.11cqw) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95)\"` with deep drop shadow (`text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.7)`) so the outline typography stays sharp, bright, and legible across mobile, tablet, and desktop screens."
    modified_response: "### What Happened and Why It Was Not Showing\n\nThe text was actually present in the code, but two issues caused it to be invisible in the browser:\n\n1. **Animation State (`opacity: 0`)**: The component was wrapped in `<motion.h1 initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 30 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}>`. During server-side rendering in Next.js, the text rendered with inline `opacity: 0`, and if the animation didn\'t immediately fire on client mount, it stayed completely invisible.\n2. **Container Clipping (`overflow-hidden`)**: The hero image container had `overflow-hidden` with `bottom: -2.8cqw`, which physically clipped and hid the typography outside its bounding box.\n\n### How It Has Been Fixed\n\n- **Guaranteed Visibility**: Removed the `opacity: 0` initial state and replaced it with direct, permanent visibility (`z-30 pointer-events-none`).\n- **Two Distinct Lines**:\n  - **Line 1**: `POWER YOUR`\n  - **Line 2**: `PONTETIALE`\n- **Zero Clipping**: Switched the wrapper containers to `overflow-visible` so the bottom position (`bottom: -2.8cqw`) is never cut off.\n- **Responsive Text Stroke**: Applied `WebkitTextStroke: \"max(1.2px, 0.11cqw) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95)\"` with deep drop shadow (`text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.7)`) so the outline typography stays sharp, bright, and legible across mobile, tablet, and desktop screens."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
